# Panes - colab (actions/colab/colab_panes.kbd)
**panes + h**        -- Prev Cell
**panes + l**        -- Next Cell
**panes + up**       -- Prev Cell
**panes + j**        -- Next Cell
**panes + move + h** -- Move Cell Up
**panes + move + l** -- Move Cell Down
**panes + move + k** -- Move Cell Up
**panes + move + j** -- Move Cell Down
